{"ID":"20240220132559-xt77st1","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132559-xt77st1","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132559-xt77st1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312172020-uju9sbl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312172020-vhi18zr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312172020-vhi18zr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:28,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:28\u0026#125;","title":"【麻黄升麻汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312172020"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312172020-uju9sbl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172020-uju9sbl","updated":"20240312172020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百七十二条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172020-6wktb0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172020-6wktb0r","updated":"20240312172020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」六七日，大下后，寸脉沉而迟，手足厥逆，下部脉不至，咽喉不利，唾脓血，泄利不止者，为难治，「麻黄升麻汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172020-vwcg3vg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172020-vwcg3vg","updated":"20240312172020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"照理太阳伤寒表症，大下，结胸。现在不是，“寸脉沉而迟，手足厥逆，下部脉不至，”尺脉摸不到。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172020-lya3anb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172020-lya3anb","updated":"20240312172020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从少阴症以后，就出来很多咽喉的问题，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阴证常常看到咽喉的问题"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。单纯看到咽喉化脓生疮，可以用半夏桂枝甘草类似这种东西。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172020-nbyvmki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172020-nbyvmki","updated":"20240312172020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝病的人会吐血出来，胃癌的病人也会吐血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果胃里寒了，吐血出来，病人最好治是吐血。如果说病人，不吐血，反而是不好治，即使看到是胃癌，里面辩证很多，不见得是同样的处方。临床上看，如果病人是半夜吐血吐出来，我们金匮里面的黄土汤是针对这个治的，这个「麻黄升麻汤」是针对肝病吐血，是寒热并用的一个方剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172020-qr3kbut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172020-qr3kbut","updated":"20240312172020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有经方家怀疑这个条辨不该放到这，年久后有些失真，因为它前后有点不连贯。唯一连贯的部分呢，麻黄升麻汤的处方是寒热并结的处方。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172020-ny028cs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172020-ny028cs","updated":"20240312172020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄升麻汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312172020-95iqfhp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172020-95iqfhp","updated":"20240312172020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄二两半去节。升麻一两一分。当归一两一分。知母、黄芩、葳蕤各十八铢。石膏碎绵裹。白朮、干姜、芍药、桂枝、茯苓、甘草炙、天门冬去心各六铢。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312172020-ien4hsu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172020-ien4hsu","updated":"20240312172020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右十四味，以水一斗，先煮麻黄一二沸，去上沫，纳诸药，煮取三升，去滓，分温三服，相去如炊三斗米顷，令尽汗出愈。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312172020-o0jf8bq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172020-o0jf8bq","updated":"20240312172020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里面药味有寒有热。你看这里用量升麻一两一分，看起来不太像是张仲景的处方，只是伤寒论里面有，我就放出来给大家看。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172020-eldeqxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172020-eldeqxy","updated":"20240312172020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"升麻常常使用在脱肛，疝气，肠子下坠，中气不足往下陷，常用升麻升提他的阳气"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172020-odoyeoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172020-odoyeoe","updated":"20240312172020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葳蕤又叫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"玉竹"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"专门治疗咽喉不利、发炎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172020-kcai6o1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172020-kcai6o1","updated":"20240312172020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“知母、黄芩、葳蕤各十八铢”一般是三钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172020-cpa0ljk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172020-cpa0ljk","updated":"20240312172020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石膏打碎棉裹用。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172020-v68u2vc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172020-v68u2vc","updated":"20240312172020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白朮茯苓能够去湿，从小便排出来。干姜能够去寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172020-pp2hnzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172020-pp2hnzy","updated":"20240312172020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是一个比较复杂的方子，临床上，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝病吐血可以用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个方子，玉竹有止血功能，当归有补血功能。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172020-vhi18zr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172020-vhi18zr","updated":"20240312172020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 胃出血不是这样用。胃癌有黄土汤，如果是吐血就用黄土汤。"}]}]}